d 'SURARDL': module to perform seemingly unrelated ARDL cointegration and bounds testing
d
d   surardl estimates the seemingly unrelated autoregressive
d distributed lag (SUR-ARDL) model of Arif and Furuoka (2026),
d which writes the Pesaran, Shin and Smith (2001) conditional
d error-correction specification for each of N cross-sectional
d units and estimates the N equations jointly as a Zellner (1962)
d SUR system by feasible GLS. Because the ARDL lag structure
d absorbs short-run dynamics and regressor endogeneity
d parametrically, the estimator needs only the N x N
d contemporaneous error covariance rather than the 2N x 2N long-run
d covariance required by the fully modified SUR estimator of
d Wagner, Grabarczyk and Hong (2020) or the banded inverse
d autocovariance of Lin and Reuvers (2025). It is intended for
d panels with small N and moderate to large T. 
d
d KW: ARDL
d KW: cointegration
d KW: bounds testing
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261010
d
d Author:   Merwan Roudane, NA
d Support: email  merwanroudane920@@gmail.com
d
f surardl.ado
f surardl.sthlp
f surardl_methods.sthlp
f surardl_p.ado
f surardl_postestimation.sthlp
f surardl_estat.ado
f surardl_asean6.do
f surardl_asean6.dta
f surardl_example.do
